; ted-realsave-error-still-writes (#380): after a failed Write, realsave
; stops writing lines but still writes the .xtra file and the icon.
; blitz2 under inject, the second Write on bo.bas fails; SAVE, TED's error
; requester (OKAY).  Correct: neither bo.bas.xtra nor bo.bas.info is
; written; the original writes both.
; @file bo.bas "a=1\nb=2\nc=3\n"
; @source F bo.bas
; @command TEDAB:tools/inject writefail=bo.bas/2 blitz2:blitz2 @FILE@
; @expect stdout "inject: writefail: 1 writes failed"
; @expect absent bo.bas.xtra
; @expect absent bo.bas.info
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
menu 0 2
wait freq "Name to save file as"
freq ok
wait req "OKAY"
gad 1
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
